    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Key findings",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Data quality is the biggest finding: only 9.7% of records are valid in every field; age is usable for 24% of customers and no phone number is real.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Big tickets carry the revenue: $750+ orders are 26% of orders but 45% of the $1.02M revenue (average order $510).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Satisfaction is split: average 3.03 / 5, with 39% dissatisfied (1-2) and 39% satisfied (4-5), the same in every segment.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Sales are flat: about 60 purchases and $29K a month, no trend (p = 0.48); Jan-Jun revenue +1.3% in 2024 and -2.6% in 2025.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- No seasonality: Aug-Sep only look low because they occur in 2 of the years covered; per 30 days all months are alike (p = 0.82).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- No segment stands out: gender, age, category, weekday and email provider show no significant difference in order value or rating (all p >= 0.09).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- 26% of revenue ($268K) has no product category.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Recommendations",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. Fix data capture: date of birth instead of age, drop-downs for gender / category / rating, validated dates and phones, no duplicate IDs (target: 90%+ complete records).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. Back-fill the 565 uncategorised purchases from the order system.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. Add a reason code to every rating and follow up 1-2 star customers within 48 hours (targets: rating 3.5, dissatisfied below 25%).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4. Protect $750+ orders (45% of revenue) and A/B-test upgrades for $250-749 orders; use experiments, not demographic targeting.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "5. Use one customer ID across orders so repeat rate and lifetime value can be measured; track purchases against the ~60 / month baseline.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Note: the file behaves like randomly generated data (uniform amounts and ages, equally likely ratings, gender unrelated to name), so flat results are expected.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
